<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Goodbye To a World (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864859263"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="01:32.639"><div begin="00:31.562" end="01:32.639"><p begin="00:31.562" end="00:37.947" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:31.562" end="00:32.528">Thank</span> <span begin="00:32.528" end="00:34.256">you,</span> <span begin="00:34.723" end="00:34.961">I'll</span> <span begin="00:34.961" end="00:35.302">say</span> <span begin="00:35.302" end="00:35.682">good</span><span begin="00:35.682" end="00:36.622">bye</span> <span begin="00:36.622" end="00:37.947">soon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">谢谢你 我很快就会道出离别</span></p><p begin="00:38.579" end="00:46.583" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:38.579" end="00:38.989">Though</span> <span begin="00:38.989" end="00:39.271">it's</span> <span begin="00:39.271" end="00:39.596">the</span> <span begin="00:39.596" end="00:39.948">end</span> <span begin="00:39.948" end="00:40.299">of</span> <span begin="00:40.299" end="00:40.576">the</span> <span begin="00:40.576" end="00:41.446">world,</span> <span begin="00:42.591" end="00:42.886">don't</span> <span begin="00:42.886" end="00:43.213">blame</span> <span begin="00:43.213" end="00:43.596">your</span><span begin="00:43.596" end="00:45.514">self,</span> <span begin="00:45.598" end="00:46.583">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使这是世界的终结 也不要责备自己</span></p><p begin="00:46.968" end="00:57.476" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:46.968" end="00:47.175">And</span> <span begin="00:47.175" end="00:47.565">if</span> <span begin="00:47.565" end="00:48.421">it's</span> <span begin="00:48.421" end="00:50.125">true,</span> <span begin="00:50.545" end="00:50.843">I</span> <span begin="00:50.843" end="00:51.156">will</span> <span begin="00:51.156" end="00:51.360">sur</span><span begin="00:51.360" end="00:52.490">round</span> <span begin="00:52.490" end="00:53.737">you</span> <span begin="00:53.894" end="00:54.181">and</span> <span begin="00:54.181" end="00:54.472">give</span> <span begin="00:54.472" end="00:54.768">life</span> <span begin="00:54.768" end="00:54.941">to</span> <span begin="00:54.941" end="00:55.453">a</span> <span begin="00:55.453" end="00:57.476">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果这是真实的 我会用臂弯将你环绕 为世界带去生机</span></p><p begin="00:58.820" end="01:01.432" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:58.820" end="00:59.051">That's</span> <span begin="00:59.051" end="00:59.411">our</span> <span begin="00:59.411" end="01:01.432">own</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那只属于我们彼此</span></p><p begin="01:03.443" end="01:09.647" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="01:03.443" end="01:04.201">Thank</span> <span begin="01:04.201" end="01:05.499">you,</span> <span begin="01:06.468" end="01:06.757">I'll</span> <span begin="01:06.757" end="01:07.020">say</span> <span begin="01:07.020" end="01:07.422">good</span><span begin="01:07.422" end="01:08.288">bye</span> <span begin="01:08.288" end="01:09.647">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">谢谢你 现在 我就要说出再见</span></p><p begin="01:10.383" end="01:16.939" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:10.383" end="01:10.646">Though</span> <span begin="01:10.646" end="01:10.983">it's</span> <span begin="01:10.983" end="01:11.331">the</span> <span begin="01:11.331" end="01:11.688">end</span> <span begin="01:11.688" end="01:11.969">of</span> <span begin="01:11.969" end="01:12.317">the</span> <span begin="01:12.317" end="01:13.073">world,</span> <span begin="01:14.301" end="01:14.653">don't</span> <span begin="01:14.653" end="01:14.952">blame</span> <span begin="01:14.952" end="01:15.444">your</span><span begin="01:15.444" end="01:16.939">self</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使这是世界的终结 也不要责备自己</span></p><p begin="01:18.623" end="01:28.748" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:18.623" end="01:18.932">And</span> <span begin="01:18.932" end="01:19.348">if</span> <span begin="01:19.348" end="01:20.205">it's</span> <span begin="01:20.205" end="01:21.570">true,</span> <span begin="01:22.304" end="01:22.558">I</span> <span begin="01:22.558" end="01:22.938">will</span> <span begin="01:22.938" end="01:23.385">sur</span><span begin="01:23.385" end="01:24.286">round</span> <span begin="01:24.286" end="01:25.114">you</span> <span begin="01:25.681" end="01:25.874">and</span> <span begin="01:25.874" end="01:26.264">give</span> <span begin="01:26.264" end="01:26.573">life</span> <span begin="01:26.573" end="01:26.813">to</span> <span begin="01:26.813" end="01:27.345">a</span> <span begin="01:27.345" end="01:28.748">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果这是真实的 我会用臂弯将你环绕 为世界带去生机</span></p><p begin="01:30.566" end="01:32.639" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:30.566" end="01:30.993">That's</span> <span begin="01:30.993" end="01:31.285">our</span> <span begin="01:31.285" end="01:32.639">own</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那便是曾经的我们</span></p></div></body></tt>